    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WYOMING COWBOYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wyoming Cowboys is a college basketball team based in Laramie, Wyoming, looking to bolster its frontcourt depth with Uche Nsonwu-Amadi."</data>
